fix for CVE-2026-69248

A permitted DNS name was treated as covering a wildcard SAN.
cryptography 47.0.0 still has the bug. This is only the code change.
The in-crate tests are omitted. The crate list is unchanged.

source: https://github.com/pyca/cryptography/commit/4d035a4225965edeffd312079a510ef25fcfdcb2
author: Rohit Goswami (HaoZeke)

